POL1 (PlayOnline) packing format
--------------------------------
skills/ffxi-re/xibin.py contains an implementation of Square Enix's POL1 packing
format (the LZSS-based protection on FFXiMain.dll, pol.exe, polcore.dll and related
PlayOnline modules), in the function lzss_pol1. Credit for publicly documenting this
format goes to atom0s, whose write-up "Unpacking FFXi Files For Static Analysis"
(2015) is the clearest public description of it.

This implementation was written from atom0s's public description of the format's
observable behaviour and validated byte-exact against packed/unpacked oracle files,
rather than translated from any copyrighted source - a clean-room reimplementation.
The attribution is kept in the lzss_pol1 docstring alongside this notice.
